  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "With Miao Jun she discusses Great Heavenly Sword Sect matters when Ying Wu Xie’s request arrives. She frowns that the boss is mysterious, that they have only joined Defy for a short time without learning the boss’s information, and that the first contact already demands Immortal Gu.",
