    {
      "text": "Miao Jun agrees they joined Defy hoping for help leaving Immortal Crane Sect, got none, and calls the borrow request shameless. After Immortal Crane Sect takes care of Great Heavenly Sword Sect, their lives grow tough. They refuse the Immortal Gu loan, and Ying Wu Xie later names them in anger.",
